cture on primitive cultures.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n2:v:現象\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">現象</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">现象</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">これは<ruby>世界中<rp>(</rp><rt>せかいじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られる<ruby>現象<rp>(</rp><rt>げんしょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">这是全世界都能看到的现象。</span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">厳重</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんじゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">严格；严厉；严密；严实；坚固；牢固</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">限度</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">限度；界限；范围</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83764\"><ruby>物事<rp>(</rp><rt>ものごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>限度<rp>(</rp><rt>げんど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There is a limit to everything.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">現に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">げんに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href